{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Arba.</b> The name of a great man among the Anakim, and since he was Abraham, this is by way of derash, for he was not among the Anakim. And when Sarah died, Abraham was in another place; therefore it says, \"and Abraham came.\"" "<b>And to weep for her.</b> To weep over her. Similarly, \"and she shall weep for her father\" (Deuteronomy 21:13)."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {0 "Resolved ע\"כ as על־כן (\"therefore\")."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:45:28.356184016Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}